-## Get a token and validate it
+## Click ID and first-party cookie
 
-1. Open the official Taboola Ads console or request access from the account team.
-2. Create the advertiser, pixel, data source, or API connection.
-3. Generate the credential required by the official API. Store it as `TABOOLA_ADS_TOKEN`.
-4. Keep the credential in a server-side secret store.
+Taboola automatically appends `tblci={click_id}` to ad URLs by default.
+The Click ID is case-sensitive and must pass through without truncation or
+corruption. See [manual Click ID handling](https://developers.taboola.com/pixel/docs/s2s-manual-integration).
 
